  <Translations>
    <Translation Language="en-US">Your discount code no longer applies, so we removed it. You weren't charged. Check the total and try again.</Translation>
    <Translation Language="es-CO">Tu código de descuento ya no aplica y lo quitamos: no se te cobró nada. Revisa el total y vuelve a intentarlo.</Translation>
  </Translations>
